  "contentHtml": "<!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">8</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">시 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">30</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">분 등교</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">, 40</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">분까지 조례</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">아침에 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">10</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">분간 무얼 할 수 있을까</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">? 3</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">월초부터 이 문제를 두고 고민하다 우리 반 아이들을 설득하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">“</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">은행이 몇 시에 문을 열지요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">?” </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">“9</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">시요.</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">” </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">“</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그렇다면 은행원들은 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">시에 출근하겠네요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">.” </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">“</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그건 아닌 것 같은데요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">미리 와서 준비해야 하지 않을까요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">?”</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\">  &nbsp;  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">고개를 갸우뚱하는 아이들도 있었지만</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">,‘</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">수업 준비를 마치고 교실에 앉아있는 시간이 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">8</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">시 반</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">’</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이라고 결론을 내렸습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">저의 이른 출근시간도 설득에 한 몫 하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\">  &nbsp;  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">월 중순까지는 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">8</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">시 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">33</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">분</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">, 36</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">분에 등교하는 아이들이 몇 명씩은 있었습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">. 30</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">분까지 오기는 하는데 홈베이스</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">본교는 교과교실제</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">에 들르지 않고 헐레벌떡 교실로 직행하는 아이들도 여럿 나왔지요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">더 이상 늦게 오는 아이들이 없게 되었을 때 또 다른 설득을 이어갔습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">“8</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">시 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">30</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">분</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">땡 하면 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">10</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">분 동안 할 수 있는 무언가를 해보자고요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">.” </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\">  &nbsp;  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">제가 교실에 들어간 시간은 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">분을 앞당긴 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">8</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">시 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">27</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">분이었습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">. “</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">세젤예</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">세상에서 젤로 예쁜 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">학년 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">~</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">반의 줄임말</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">)”</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">라고 부르며 교실에 들어가기를 여러 날</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">, 4</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">월 초반부터는 자리에 앉아서 무언가를 하는 습관이 형성되어 갔습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">책상 위에 아무 것도 올려놓지 않은 채 멍 때리고 있는 아이들도 여전히 있었지만요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\">  &nbsp;  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">학습팀장에게 조언을 구하였더니 아침 시간에 수행평가인 한자쓰기 테스트를 대비하면 좋겠다고 했습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">준비 후 실시한 테스트에서 </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">모두 만점(아쉽게도 5명은 미달)을 받았다고 아이들이 좋아하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">한문 선생님의 폭풍 칭찬도 받았고요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">. 5</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">회까지 가는 동안 아침에 집중하여 복습한 효과를 톡톡히 봤습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\">  &nbsp;  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그러는 동안 서서히 그러나 눈에 띄게 학급 분위기가 변하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">등교하여 바로 삼삼오오 모여앉아 조곤조곤 낮은 소리로 대화를 나누며 공부하는 모드로 바뀐 것이지요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">보고서 쓰기 과제는 감을 잡지 못하고 거의 백지 상태로 있는 친구들에게 학습팀원들이 도우미 역할을 하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">수학이 부족한 아이는 수학을 잘 하는 친구가 자발적으로 옆에 앉아 넘어가지 못하는 부분을 도와주었습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\">  &nbsp;  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">중간고사 결과가 나왔을 때 담임인 저는 흡족하였는데 아이들은 그렇지 않았던 모양입니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">일단 한 명씩 면담을 하고 목표를 정하도록 하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">. (</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">예를 들면</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">국어가 중간고사 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">88</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">점인데 기말에 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">92</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">점을 받으면 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">A</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">가 된다는 식으로</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">내신 성적 산출 방법을 설명해주었습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">수행평가 만점이라는 가정 하에</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">) </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\">  &nbsp;  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">면담의 효과는 수행평가 전원제출로 이어졌습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">수행평가는 한 만큼 정직하게 결과가 나온다고 이해를 한 것이지요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">중간고사 전까지는 수행평가 미제출자가 과목에 따라 한두 명</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">많은 때는 서너 명</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">씩은 있었거든요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그럼에도 불구하고 끝까지 안 내는 아이가 있었는데 학급 분위기가 쏴</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">~</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">하게 변하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">.‘</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">학생이 어찌 숙제를 내지 않는단 말인가</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">?’40</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">년 전에 중학교 수학 선생님이 하신 말씀인데 우리 반 아이들에게 듣다니 감회가 새로웠습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">.^^  </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">결국 분위기에 밀려 내더라고요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\">  &nbsp;  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">학습모드로의 전환은 반장</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">부반장</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">학습팀원들의 역할도 컸지만 교수기기 팀장의 공헌도 칭찬하고 싶습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">모 과목 선생님이 거꾸로 교실을 하면서 동영상을 시청하고 기록하는&nbsp;과제를 내었습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">. 교수기기 팀장이 </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">스마트 폰이 없거나 집에 인터넷이 연결되지 않은 아이들을 배려하여 아침에 스마트 폰을 활용하여 전원이 과제를 하도록 자리를 재배치하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이 과목 저 과목 선생님들로부터 수행평가와 수업태도에 대한 칭찬이 들려오더니</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">‘</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">매우 만족</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">’</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">으로 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">학기가 마무리되었습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\">  &nbsp;  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">지필고사와 수행평가 뿐만 아니라 체육대회</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">합창대회</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">각종 교내 대회에서도 노력의 결과를 보상받았습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">올해 우리 반 아이들을 통해서 얻은 교훈이 많습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그리고 담임의 진심을 이해해주는 참 고마운 아이들입니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\">  &nbsp;  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">본교는 월</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">금요일에는 방송이 나오므로</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">‘10</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">분 학습'은</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\"> 매주 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">일간 한 활동입니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\">  &nbsp;  </p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
